"SIG"? Special Interest Group, perhaps?

I'm glad to say I'll probably have more time at this Penguicon for
Lojbanic pursuits because I'm not chairing the whole convention this
year, just making the Souvenir Book and Schedule Book. The activities
to which I currently have committed include

1. Running a Dominion tournament (a card game that has almost
completely taken over my life, some would say).
2. Presenting on Motion Capture Animation, from what I have learned in
gaining a certificate as a mocap technician.
3. Teaching a hands-on workshop in the computer lab about how to use
the InForm7 system to create Interactive Fiction.

I'm trying to track down precisely what I've committed to, but outside
of those events I think I'm free. :)

Now I'm going to write an email to Trevor Jagoda, the head of
programming, to add "Intro to Lojban" to the schedule.

-Matt


